                        "glosses": [
                            "One who follows the doctrines of Thomas Hobbes; a Hobbesian."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4899f57-11ba-4778-8fdf-db018de5975c",
                                "sense_id": "21950f14-be2e-3ae3-afbc-1de3c2a5eddf",
                                "text": "[I]f a Chriſtian, vvho has the view of Happineſs and Miſery in another Life, be asked vvhy a Man muſt keep his VVord, he vvill give this as a Reaſon: Becauſe God, vvho has the Povver of eternal Life and Death, requires it of us. But if an Hobbiſt be asked vvhy; he vvill anſvver, Becauſe the Publick requires it, and the Leviathan vvill puniſh you, if you do not."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b4f72223-09ed-4bf1-a998-4ef1a10e4f76",
                                "sense_id": "21950f14-be2e-3ae3-afbc-1de3c2a5eddf",
                                "text": "Many of the accused were Hobbists and Infidels, and some common ill-living Protestants: Shall all the Hobbists, and Infidels, and ill-living Protestants be Extirpated for their faults?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
